; [move-elements-to-editor] BonusStrip and CompareFlyout were both instanced in
; _ready() - the strip with a move_child(1) to slide it under the header, the
; flyout appended last so unhandled input reaches it before this modal does.
; Both are authored children now, in exactly those positions, so their order and
; the strip's size are visible and editable here instead of being asserted in
; code.

; [ui-project-longshot] Was a flat scarlet square. Nothing else on the board is
; scarlet, and a saturated red block in the header pulled harder than the shop's
; own contents; it is a dark stone disc with a gold rim now, matching the
; medallions on the upgrade cards.
